# spec: ANC on/off is bit 0 of the [1.5] flags byte, so flags 02 (bit 1 set) reads as ANC off and set_cnc_presets switches ANC on for the [1.15] write.
# source: NOTES.md, NC 700 section ([1.5] flags: bit 0 = enabled; bit 1 clear = the user may switch CNC on/off). Synthetic: flags 02 has not been seen on hardware; the replies follow the [1.5] and [1.15] layouts.
device nc700
call set_cnc_presets 0 5 10
send 01 05 01 00
recv 01 05 03 03 0b 00 02
send 01 05 02 02 00 01
recv 01 05 03 03 0b 00 03
send 01 0f 02 04 00 00 05 0a
recv 01 0f 03 04 00 00 05 0a
send 01 05 02 02 00 01
recv 01 05 03 03 0b 00 03
send 01 05 02 02 00 00
recv 01 05 03 03 0b 00 02
result ok
